# The generated documents are written with newline="\n" so that a rebuild
# produces a byte-identical file on any platform. Keep the checkout matching
# that, or a Windows clone (where git's autocrlf default rewrites everything to
# CRLF) would report every line as changed in `git diff`, and a committed CRLF
# shebang would not execute on Linux.
* text=auto eol=lf
